      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_3pqmad": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shopify Plus & Custom Architecture:",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Expert in modular Liquid templating, Shopify Functions, and custom app development. I specialize in backend problem-solving, such as architecting AWS Lambda solutions to bypass slow third-party APIs and achieve instant on-page rendering.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_cPLTYE": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Performance & Conversion Optimization (CRO):",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Proven track record of transforming legacy themes into high-performing platforms. I consistently drive up Lighthouse scores and engineer technical A/B tests that yield double-digit conversion lifts.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_zRWDUn": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Complex Integrations & Subscriptions:",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Deep experience managing advanced subscription logic (Recharge), dynamic custom bundling, and tiered quantity-based pricing models designed to increase Average Order Value (AOV).</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_38GhnM": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "AI-Accelerated Workflows:",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>I actively integrate LLMs (Claude, Gemini) into my daily development operations. By utilizing AI for rapid boilerplate generation and complex bug tracing, I consistently reduce time-to-delivery on custom applications and landing pages by 30%.&nbsp;</p><p><em>While customizing the checkout styles on this demo with the Branding API, </em><em><strong>AI </strong></em><em>couldn't figure it out! It was breaking the styles throughout the account pages and checkout - but through my knowledge I knew to setup a new scheme, configure, and place it into the GraphQL query for more precise targeting.&nbsp;</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
