          "settings": {
            "text": "<ul><li>Elevated direct to consumer web experience by increasing site performance and conversion rates through <strong>4 consecutive Inc. 5000 awards</strong>.</li><li>Engineered scalable AWS Lambda serverless architectures (custom APIs, middleware proxies, scheduled tasks) to eliminate storefront bottlenecks.</li><li>Managed and overhauled complex Shopify integrations.</li><li>Accelerated the storefront development pipeline and slashed new landing page development time by 30% by integrating AI tools (Gemini, Claude) for rapid Liquid boilerplate generation and complex bug tracing.</li></ul>"
          }
